    "# %%\n",
    "# ── 14. Final Benchmark Assembly & Diverse Visualisation (Resample-Aware, Dedup-Aware) ──\n",
    "# Mirrors cfn_benchmark_builder.ipynb's Cell 14: a rerun reconciles against\n",
    "# the EXISTING frozen final_benchmark_with_prompts.csv so that rows a human\n",
    "# has already reviewed keep their stable row_number across reruns -- they\n",
    "# are never silently renumbered or dropped just because the pipeline reran.\n",
    "# Only rows that actually fail a gate (missing from the latest deploy cache)\n",
    "# or are on the manual exclusion list below get dropped and replaced by\n",
    "# resampling. The shortfall-fill loop is itself dedup-aware (checks each new\n",
    "# candidate's content against both the kept set and already-accepted-new\n",
    "# rows in this run via a blocking key + difflib.quick_ratio), so it should\n",
    "# never need a second post-hoc dedup pass -- see the Cell 14b check below\n",
    "# for catching any near-duplicate that slips through anyway (e.g. across\n",
    "# separate resample runs).\n",
